Dame Quay is a [[Org/The Scale/index|Scale]] Pactbroker and Argyle's contact within the organization. She answers his calls at a private line and keeps the file on his work, and she has offered to send an information packet to his residence when there is anything to report.

When Argyle reported the two [[Ugathal]] that ambushed the party in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], she said she would ask members of the [[Org/The Scale/index|Everchain]] whether they had seen their like before. She is blunt and hard to satisfy; when Argyle called the members of his new group friendly, she answered that he seemed friendly too, and she would still call him dangerous.
